# Where the contact form posts.
#
# The /exec URL of the Apps Script web app in tools/contact-relay.gs, which
# appends each message to a Google Sheet and pushes it to Telegram. Setup
# steps are in the header of that file.
#
# Leave this unset and the form falls back to opening the visitor's own mail
# client with the message prefilled — no submissions are lost either way.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ is inlined into the bundle at build time, so this URL is public.
# That is by design: it only accepts messages. The Telegram bot token lives in
# the Apps Script's Script Properties and never reaches the browser.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill it in. Rebuild after changing it.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=
